sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Host as Host (App)
    participant API as PostgREST/RLS
    participant RPC as set_no_show() (SECURITY DEFINER)
    participant T as event_attendees guard trigger
    participant Cron as pg_cron award-event-points (15 min)
    participant Award as award_event_points()
    actor Player as Player (App)
    Host->>API: rpc set_no_show(event_id, user_id, true or false)
    API->>RPC: as authenticated (auth.uid() = host)
    RPC->>RPC: host or co-host? now() between start and end + 2h? target attending?
    RPC->>T: set_config vteam.no_show on, then UPDATE no_show, marked_at, marked_by
    T-->>RPC: allowed (any other UPDATE of these columns is rejected)
    RPC-->>Host: ok (optimistic badge already shown)
    Player->>API: select own event_attendees row
    API-->>Player: no_show = true (Marked as a no-show card)
    Cron->>Award: every 15 min
    Award->>Award: once end + 2h has passed, pay every attending player not flagged
    Award-->>Player: point_events row (+2 / +5), balance trigger as today
